      "Language": "chi",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Chronic orchialgia, whose positive signs defy routine examinations, is usually misdiagnosised as chronic prostatitis or a psychological disorder. This paper aims at introducing the definition, etiology, diagnosis and management of chronic orchialgia, as well as a reappraisal and refinement of the traditional treatment of the disease."},
